</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.5.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T9.5.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A2.T9.5.8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Capability Encoder setting</span></th>
<td id="A2.T9.5.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.5.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:186.3pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.5.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.5.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Random init + trainable</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.5.9" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T9.5.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A2.T9.5.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Ranking pair mode</span></th>
<td id="A2.T9.5.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.5.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:186.3pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.5.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.5.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Cross-model only</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.5.10" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T9.5.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T9.5.10.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Predicted-cond supervision</span></th>
